{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.QBeta.StageCSigma3LiftObligation","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.QBeta.StageCSigma3LiftObligation","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Algebra.Ring.Defs","lean:module:Mathlib.Algebra.Order.Ring.Defs","lean:module:Mathlib.Algebra.Order.Ring.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic.Ring","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic.Linarith"],"declarations":16,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.StageC.sigma3_lift_kill_test","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.StageC.sigma3_lift_kill_test","kind":"theorem","line":164,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/StageCSigma3LiftObligation.lean#L164-L177","doc":"**The Stage-C kill-test, composed (machine-checked form of the 1jrh gated\ntest).**  Any valid σ₃-lift feeds the decision: under the measured sign tiers\n(`W₂ > 0` by `W2_pos_of_sign_tiers`), if the lift's genuine `c₄^even` rung and\na genuine (beyond-CAL-anchor) `c₄^odd` rung give `W₃ ≤ 0`, the single-AW-\nrecurrence identification is refuted.  The indicative `W₃ < 0` lean from the\nuntrusted c₄ inputs (c₃^even measurement audit) is exactly the scenario this\ntheorem would convert into a decision once genuine rungs exist. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.StageC.one_recurrence_incompatible","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.StageC.one_recurrence_incompatible","kind":"theorem","line":156,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/StageCSigma3LiftObligation.lean#L156-L162","doc":"**The decision rule.**  With `W₂ > 0`, genuine c₄ rungs giving `W₃ ≤ 0`\nare incompatible with the one-recurrence hypothesis.  Scope-(a): this refutes\nthe *single-AW-recurrence identification* of the ladder, not any ingredient. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.StageC.casoratianSignCompatible","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.StageC.casoratianSignCompatible","kind":"def","line":151,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/StageCSigma3LiftObligation.lean#L151-L154","doc":"The Casoratian sign compatibility a SINGLE Askey–Wilson (orthogonal-\npolynomial) three-term recurrence imposes on adjacent rung Casoratians:\nconstant sign, i.e. `0 < W₂·W₃`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.StageC.W2_pos_of_sign_tiers","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.StageC.W2_pos_of_sign_tiers","kind":"theorem","line":137,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/StageCSigma3LiftObligation.lean#L137-L149","doc":"**Sign-tier robustness of `W₂ > 0`.**  For ANY rung values in the measured\nsign tiers — `c₂^even < 0` (measured `≈ −8.006`), `c₃^even > 0` (measured\n`≈ +86.66`), `c₂^odd = −1` (proved, Taylor-exact), `c₃^odd < 0` (near-match\n`≈ −2`) — the `W₂` Casoratian is positive.  The audit's `W₂ ≈ +102.67` is an\ninstance; this shows the sign needs only the tiers. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.StageC.c4even_bar_even","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.StageC.c4even_bar_even","kind":"theorem","line":125,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/StageCSigma3LiftObligation.lean#L125-L130","doc":"Any valid lift's rung is itself bar-even — derived from the two trace\nfields via the C12 reading (the class composes; the rung inherits the ladder's\neven-channel parity, as the scope's bar-evenness invariant demands). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.StageC.StageCSigma3Lift.shadow_bar_even","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.StageC.StageCSigma3Lift.shadow_bar_even","kind":"theorem","line":123,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/StageCSigma3LiftObligation.lean#L123-L123","doc":"Bar-evenness of the H₃ shadow trace. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.StageC.StageCSigma3Lift.bar_even","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.StageC.StageCSigma3Lift.bar_even","kind":"theorem","line":121,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/StageCSigma3LiftObligation.lean#L121-L121","doc":"Bar-evenness of the H₄ trace. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.StageC.StageCSigma3Lift.sigma3_gating","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.StageC.StageCSigma3Lift.sigma3_gating","kind":"theorem","line":119,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/StageCSigma3LiftObligation.lean#L119-L119","doc":"σ₃-gating non-degeneracy: the lift carries genuine level-4 content. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.StageC.StageCSigma3Lift.c4even_eq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.StageC.StageCSigma3Lift.c4even_eq","kind":"theorem","line":117,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/StageCSigma3LiftObligation.lean#L117-L117","doc":"C12 stabilization-constant-1 reading: `c₄^even = tr_M^{H₄}(Λ) − tr_M^{H₃}(shadow)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.StageC.StageCSigma3Lift.c4even","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.StageC.StageCSigma3Lift.c4even","kind":"def","line":115,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/StageCSigma3LiftObligation.lean#L115-L115","doc":"The induced level-4 (c₄^even) rung. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.StageC.StageCSigma3Lift.shadowH3","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.StageC.StageCSigma3Lift.shadowH3","kind":"def","line":113,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/StageCSigma3LiftObligation.lean#L113-L113","doc":"`tr_M^{H₃}` of the σ₃-free H₃ shadow of Λ. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.StageC.StageCSigma3Lift.trH4","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.StageC.StageCSigma3Lift.trH4","kind":"def","line":111,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/StageCSigma3LiftObligation.lean#L111-L111","doc":"`tr_M^{H₄}(Λ)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.StageC.StageCSigma3Lift.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.StageC.StageCSigma3Lift.mk","kind":"ctor","line":109,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/StageCSigma3LiftObligation.lean#L109-L109","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.StageC.StageCSigma3Lift","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.StageC.StageCSigma3Lift","kind":"class","line":86,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/StageCSigma3LiftObligation.lean#L86-L123","doc":"**Conjecture carrier (OPEN — the Stage-C σ₃-lift obligation; bean `1jrh`\nhandoff): the categorical lift `Λ ∈ H₄(q)` of the free-neutron-decay operator.**\n\nA lift supplies its two Markov-trace values and the level-4 rung they induce:\n\n* `trH4` — `tr_M^{H₄}(Λ)`, evaluable by the shipped Stage-C instrumented base\n  (`computations/habiro/qbeta_h4_stagec_markov_infra.py`) once Λ is specified.\n* `shadowH3` — `tr_M^{H₃}` of Λ's σ₃-free H₃ shadow.\n* `c4even_eq` — the level-4 rung reads **directly** as the difference: the\n  H₃→H₄ stabilization constant is exactly 1 in the Wenzl normalization\n  (Stage-C infra audit, gate C12 at 1e-50 across 5 q-points), so no\n  normalization constant intervenes.\n* `sigma3_gating` — non-degeneracy: a σ₃-free element's H₄ data is fully\n  determined by its H₃ data (branching preflight), hence carries zero level-4\n  content; a valid lift must have `c4even ≠ 0`.\n* `bar_even` / `shadow_bar_even` — both traces are fixed by the bar-involution\n  `σ` (the scope's bar-evenness invariant; the ladder's even channel).\n\nNO instance is provided: the open state is the honest state (§3b-tax).  The\nscope's provenance rule (Λ must be *derived* from the decay categorical\ncontent, never back-solved from a c₄ target) and the anchor-stability\nside-condition are meta-level selection rules on constructions, not fields of\nthis carrier — see the module docstring. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.StageC.rungCasoratian_with_proved_c2odd","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.StageC.rungCasoratian_with_proved_c2odd","kind":"theorem","line":75,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/StageCSigma3LiftObligation.lean#L75-L80","doc":"With the **proved** rung `c₂^odd = −1` (Taylor-exact) substituted, the\n`W₂` Casoratian collapses to `c₂^even·c₃^odd + c₃^even`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QBeta.StageC.rungCasoratian","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QBeta.StageC.rungCasoratian","kind":"def","line":67,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QBeta/StageCSigma3LiftObligation.lean#L67-L73","doc":"The **rung Casoratian** `W = cₖᵉ·cₖ₊₁ᵒ − cₖ₊₁ᵉ·cₖᵒ` of two adjacent\nladder rungs, each carrying a bar-even and a bar-odd component.  For a ladder\ngenerated by ONE three-term recurrence with bar-even multiplier\n(`recurrence_invol_descent`), adjacent-rung Casoratians keep a constant sign;\n`W` is the quantity the 1jrh sign test evaluates. ","signatureChunk":0}]}